^"stream"{
 >>[2026-10-12] read — the Status holds: 33 distinct cauldron attribute names by its own count, nothing in the cauldron folders since October 6, and no SPELL_CONTRACT (breadcrumb-spell.js has SPW_BREADCRUMB_SPELL_CONTRACT, a different thing). The decompose walk on /design/experiments/spellcraft/ still waits on the creator. Meanwhile the leftover phase 1 write can move without that walk: resonance.js:102 sets data-spw-cauldron-phase on html, dom-sync-hub.js:71 lists it, and six html rules in palette-depth.css read it.
}

^"open"{
